  "details": "Description\n\nAll menu toggles and puppets are not synced for everyone, All avatar animations seem to only work in local state.. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nin beta build. see if any menu toggle, animation or puppet toggle can be seen between each player.  Open the hand radial menu, go to Any of your uploaded avatar toggles, such as clothing, assets, or any animation. turn them on. it will be on for yourself. but wont be on for anyone else\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-15_23-43-24.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_2260a839-3953-4c7a-b8fc-4e7f2ff27424/1/file)",
